AB  - We report the draft genome sequences of two Beauveria bassiana strains, Bb-NCHU-143 and Bb-NCHU-153, isolated from mycosed coleopteran (beetles) in Taiwan. Genome assemblies were generated using a hybrid genome assembly approach. The draft genomes of Bb-NCHU-143 and Bb-NCHU-153 are 34.21 Mb (7,994 genes) and 34.20 Mb (7,151 genes), respectively.
